@title Clicking the tip of an interruption arrow wires its pin
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Test report 14: the interruption point's only pin is at the arrow tail, so a click on the tip did nothing. The whole arrow picks the pin now.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key q
text interruption
key Return
click 600 300
wait 5
key Escape
wait 5
shot placed
click_text Corners
wait 3
click 598 313
wait 5
shot wire-from-tip
expect "click a pin or wire to finish"
